# Copy to `gemini.env` and paste your key. That file is gitignored, exactly like
# central-live.env, and nothing reads it except the agent-authoring gate.
#
# The key never enters the repository, an image, or the deploy environment: the
# gate types it into the Composer's own Settings, which is where the upstream
# app expects it and where it stays — in that browser profile's storage. The
# Composer is client-side, so this key is only ever used by your browser talking
# to Google directly.
#
# Get one from Google AI Studio.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
